---
source: crates/holm-markdown/tests/format_keys.rs
expression: "cases.join(\"\\n\")"
---
"one two" 1 Bold: "**one** two" at 3
"one two" 3 Italic: "*one* two" at 4
"one **two**" 8 Bold: "one two" at 6
"one " 4 Highlight: "one ====" at 6
"a  b" 2 Underline: "a <u></u> b" at 5
"- " 2 Bold: "- ****" at 4
"x `code` y" 4 Code: "x code y" at 6
"x `code` y" 4 Bold: "x **`code`** y" at 6
"```\nx y\n```" 5 Bold: no change
